WEBVTT

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:03.049
Here's a fictional property team's
workspace.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.209
Home brings the latest leads and pending

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:07.350
decisions together.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.949
Open Leads to see which opportunities are

00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:13.869
ready, warm, or still early,

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.049
and why.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.050
Switch to the table to compare contacts

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.669
and see when each was last reached.

00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:24.589
Then open Approvals to review the proposed

00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:26.329
outreach before it goes ahead.

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.369
Choose an email reply when you're ready.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.909
This demo stops before anything is sent.
